    "Platform names and logos identify their respective platforms. They belong to their owners and do not imply affiliation or endorsement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Platform names and logos identify their respective platforms. They belong to their owners and do not imply affiliation or endorsement."}},
        "it": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nomi e loghi identificano le rispettive piattaforme. Appartengono ai rispettivi titolari e non implicano affiliazione o approvazione."}},
        "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Les noms et logos servent à identifier les plateformes. Ils appartiennent à leurs titulaires et n’impliquent ni affiliation ni approbation."}},
        "de": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Namen und Logos kennzeichnen die jeweiligen Plattformen. Sie gehören ihren Inhabern und bedeuten weder eine Zugehörigkeit noch eine Billigung."}},
        "es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los nombres y logotipos identifican sus respectivas plataformas. Pertenecen a sus titulares y no implican afiliación ni respaldo."}},
        "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Os nomes e logotipos identificam as respectivas plataformas. Pertencem a seus titulares e não implicam afiliação nem endosso."}},
        "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "平台名称和标志用于识别各自的平台，归各自的权利人所有，不代表存在关联或获得认可。"}}
      }
    },
