    "Choose where to keep your game apps. Put any existing nxnative games (.app) here. Changing folders does not move apps; rebuilds update them where they are.": {
      "comment": "SettingsLibrarySection.swift",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose where to keep your game apps. Put any existing nxnative games (.app) here. Changing folders does not move apps; rebuilds update them where they are."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scegli dove conservare le app dei giochi. Inserisci qui eventuali giochi nxnative (.app) esistenti. Cambiare cartella non sposta le app; le ricompilazioni le aggiornano dove si trovano."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez où conserver vos apps de jeux. Placez-y vos jeux nxnative existants (.app). Changer de dossier ne déplace pas les apps ; les recompilations les mettent à jour à leur emplacement actuel."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle, wo deine Spiele-Apps gespeichert werden. Lege hier auch vorhandene nxnative-Spiele (.app) ab. Ein Ordnerwechsel verschiebt keine Apps; beim erneuten Erstellen werden sie an ihrem bisherigen Ort aktualisiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige dónde guardar tus apps de juegos. Coloca aquí tus juegos existentes de nxnative (.app). Cambiar de carpeta no mueve las apps; al recompilar, se actualizan en su ubicación actual."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolha onde manter os apps dos seus jogos. Coloque aqui os jogos existentes do nxnative (.app). Alterar a pasta não move os apps; as recompilações os atualizam onde estão."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择存放游戏 App 的位置。请把现有的 nxnative 游戏（.app）放在这里。更改文件夹不会移动 App；重新构建会在原位置更新它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
