          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pasta da engine tem arquivos alterados. O Arcane nunca os modifica: guarde-os em outro local e tente novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎文件夹中有被修改的文件。Arcane 不会触碰它们：请先将它们移到别处，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine has no profile for this game, so it makes a provisional one. ": {
      "comment": "AddGameView+Rows.swift",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The engine has no profile for this game, so it makes a provisional one. "
          }
        },
        "it": {
