    "What shows while a game starts: art and logo, art only, logo on black, or minimal.": {
      "comment": "SettingsCatalog.swift",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What shows while a game starts: art and logo, art only, logo on black, or minimal."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cosa mostrare mentre si avvia un gioco: immagine e logo, solo immagine, logo su nero o stile minimale."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’affichage pendant le démarrage d’un jeu : illustration et logo, illustration seule, logo sur fond noir ou minimal."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
